{
  "_help": "Global Home. Apps browses supported tools; only OPEN activates one. Project/Profile/Page choices need Open/Use/Enter. Wheel browses; press selects only. Six Home dials: volume, apps, profiles, scroll, pages, projects. Browse/push selects only; OPEN/USE/ENTER still confirms activation. HOVER SCROLL: point at the intended pane first; clockwise scrolls down. It is a Windows pointer-wheel action, not a guarantee of scrolling the focused app.",
  "name": "Home",
  "color": "cyan",
  "stripGestures": false,
  "pages": [
